<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Credireal to be privatized April 30-paper.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Credireal to be privatized April 30-paper.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minas Gerais state bank Credireal will be sold off at a privatization auction on April 30, Gazeta Mercantil financial newspaper said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Bid specifications for the selloff will be published Friday, but the tender document will not bring Credireal's minimum price, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>Interested investors must pre-qualify for the auction, it added. Credireal's employees will have the right to acquire a stake in the bank.</p>
<p>(--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412)</p>
